---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';import {packs} from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Islamic History Timeline Challenge"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Prophetic mission edition · 610–632 CE</span> <h1>{learning.heading}</h1> <p>Arrange the cards from earliest to latest. Then read the event sources, approximate dates, and limits of what each report establishes.</p></section><section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Choose a challenge<select id="pack-select">{packs.map(p=><option value={p.id}>Challenge {p.number} · {p.title}</option>)}</select></label><label><input id="remember" type="checkbox"/> Remember this challenge for 30 days</label> <button class="button secondary" id="next-pack">Next challenge</button> <button class="text-button" id="restart">Restart</button></div></section><div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="challenge-title">Arrange the events</h2> <span class="pill">Earliest → latest</span></div> <div class="panel-body"><ol class="event-order" id="order"></ol><p id="feedback" role="status">Use the up and down buttons. Source clues are available on every card.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button" id="check">Check order</button> <button class="button secondary" id="hint">Reveal earliest event</button> <button class="text-button" id="reveal">Reveal sequence</button></div> <div class="actions top-gap"><span class="micro" id="stats"></span><button class="text-button" id="share">Copy challenge link</button></div></div></section> <aside class="sidebar"><div class="notice"><h2>Sequence before precision</h2><p>Only the broad event order is scored. Conventional dates are approximate. A report supporting an event may not supply its displayed CE year.</p><p>This edition covers selected events from the prophetic mission. More than one event may share a year.</p><a href="/sources/">Read the methodology <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></aside></div><section id="answer" class="top-gap" aria-live="polite"></section><noscript><p class="noscript">The ordering challenge requires JavaScript. You can read the source references on the Sources page.</p></noscript><script>import '../lib/app';</script></Shell>
